{"id":24,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と対話で思いやりある社会的リーダーを育成","feature_description":"東京都立三鷹中等教育学校は、6年間の一貫教育で思いやりと人間愛を持つ社会的リーダーを育てます。前期課程では「探究」を設け、文化科学・自然科学の学校設定科目や少人数指導、ICT活用を通じて、論理的思考や課題解決力を養います。国際理解やボランティア、地域との連携にも取り組み、協働の精神と思いやりの心を育てる方針です。国際的な視野も重視します。","clubs":[{"id":374,"name":"前期サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":375,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":376,"name":"ラグビー部（前期・後期）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":377,"name":"前期野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":378,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":379,"name":"前期男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":380,"name":"前期女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":381,"name":"前期男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":382,"name":"前期女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":383,"name":"前期女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":384,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/mitaka-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":385,"name":"剣道部","category":"運